cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you write about or build on LibreGet, please cite it as below."
title: LibreGet
abstract: >-
  Free, open source desktop download manager and media toolbox for Windows,
  macOS, and Linux built with Tauri 2, Rust, and Svelte 5. Supports online
  courses, social platforms, torrents, yt-dlp, local transcription, media
  conversion, and a local MCP server.
type: software
authors:
  - name: OpenSelena
    website: "https://github.com/OpenSelena"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OpenSelena/libreget"
url: "https://github.com/OpenSelena/libreget"
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - download-manager
  - media-downloader
  - course-downloader
  - yt-dlp
  - yt-dlp-gui
  - mcp-server
  - tauri
  - rust
  - svelte
